[options]
[A.]
                          <h2>Slave to the King (Attack on Sun Village)<a href="#mission4">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                                 ~[IsunFlyer.3]      ~[IsunFlyer.5]<br>
                                                         ~[IsunFlyerBomb.4] <br>
                                  ~[Ipriest.107]        ~[IsunFlyerBomb.3]~[IsunBlocker.0] ~[IsunCannon.14]~[IsunFlyerBomb.5]    ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br><br>
<br>

              <i>This is the first of many missions as the new Apprentice of Hades</i>
<p>
                Your first mission is to capture and kill the King of Sun Village.<br>
  You must travel to the Realm of Sun where the only tech useful to you is sun.<br>

<br>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                                  <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                            <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>                          <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Let the Killin Begin</a>                     <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I wanna Leave!</a>
<$Tell,sound1>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,golemMove1.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.

